# Vercel Environment Variables
# If you host the Rem audio backend (Express + yt-dlp) on a cloud service
# (such as Railway, Render, Fly.io, or VPS), provide its public URL here:
VITE_API_URL=https://your-streaming-backend.railway.app

# Note: If left unset, the frontend defaults to relative '/api' or the Server URL entered in Settings.
